WEBVTT

00:00:09.460 --> 00:00:12.460
What are you up to, young master?

00:00:13.830 --> 00:00:15.910
Practicing for sports day.

00:00:15.910 --> 00:00:19.590
The hallways here are perfect 
for practicing for the race.

00:00:20.110 --> 00:00:21.370
I see.

00:00:21.370 --> 00:00:26.100
You did mention that sports day 
is coming up soon.

00:00:26.100 --> 00:00:31.850
All your darting back and forth while shouting 
surprised me. It seemed suspicious.

00:00:31.850 --> 00:00:33.200
Suspicious?!

00:00:33.200 --> 00:00:34.880
You're one to talk!

00:00:34.880 --> 00:00:38.820
I'd like to help you practice.

00:00:39.760 --> 00:00:41.010
Help me practice?

00:00:41.010 --> 00:00:41.970
Yes.

00:00:42.260 --> 00:00:44.640
Rah, rah! Sis-boom-bah!

00:00:45.270 --> 00:00:48.150
Go, go, young master!

00:00:48.650 --> 00:00:51.400
Rah, rah! Sis-boom-bah...

00:00:52.910 --> 00:00:55.660
Why aren't you practicing with me?

00:00:56.580 --> 00:00:59.410
It was so cute, I couldn't help but stare.

00:01:00.770 --> 00:01:04.640
I think, with you rooting for me, 
I can get first place.

00:01:04.640 --> 00:01:07.370
I'm glad I can be of assistance.

00:01:07.830 --> 00:01:10.190
Don't do it on the day, though.

00:01:10.190 --> 00:01:14.800
I can't show the others how cute you are.

00:01:15.710 --> 00:01:16.880
On the day?

00:01:17.770 --> 00:01:22.470
If you'd like, could you please 
come support me on sports day?

00:01:24.070 --> 00:01:25.380
Of course!

00:02:56.610 --> 00:03:01.570
<b>Episode 5:     My Precious...</b>

00:03:04.140 --> 00:03:07.210
Young master, I've come to pick you up.

00:03:07.210 --> 00:03:08.540
Lilith...

00:03:08.540 --> 00:03:11.610
I keep telling you, you don't 
need to come pick me up.

00:03:11.610 --> 00:03:15.670
I thought you'd say that, so I debated 
whether I should until the last minute.

00:03:16.150 --> 00:03:18.510
But I couldn't wait to see your face,

00:03:18.510 --> 00:03:20.270
so I just had to come.

00:03:20.890 --> 00:03:22.550
That goes for me, too.

00:03:24.170 --> 00:03:28.230
During class, I kept thinking 
about what you might be up to.

00:03:28.230 --> 00:03:32.900
I have no idea what we studied today!

00:03:33.160 --> 00:03:36.270
Please pay attention in class...

00:03:36.270 --> 00:03:39.670
Don't come to pick me up, though. I mean that.

00:03:39.670 --> 00:03:40.990
Okay.

00:03:47.140 --> 00:03:51.660
Yuuri-san and the maid are 
always so nice to see together.

00:03:51.660 --> 00:03:55.630
Young lady, I don't believe 
you should be peeping like that.

00:03:55.630 --> 00:03:57.360
You don't get it, do you?

00:03:57.360 --> 00:03:59.830
That's part of the thrill.

00:03:59.830 --> 00:04:01.090
<i>Such questionable character...</i>

00:04:03.980 --> 00:04:05.550
How can I put it...

00:04:05.550 --> 00:04:08.390
It's such a bittersweet relationship.

00:04:08.390 --> 00:04:11.350
I wish I could experience something so exciting,

00:04:11.690 --> 00:04:15.020
or squee over an adorable servant.

00:04:15.350 --> 00:04:17.870
Let's come back to reality now, shall we?

00:04:17.870 --> 00:04:19.560
We're heading home.

00:04:19.560 --> 00:04:21.890
You're so boring! Jeez!

00:04:21.890 --> 00:04:24.780
I just wanted a little bit of a spark!

00:04:26.520 --> 00:04:30.070
Young lady, am I not sufficient?

00:04:36.980 --> 00:04:38.410
That's perfect!

00:04:38.410 --> 00:04:40.260
This is why you're my butler!

00:04:40.260 --> 00:04:41.320
I love you!

00:04:41.320 --> 00:04:42.900
Do it again!

00:04:42.900 --> 00:04:44.080
I will not.

00:04:44.080 --> 00:04:45.990
We're going home. Come.

00:04:45.990 --> 00:04:47.760
One more time!

00:04:47.760 --> 00:04:48.880
I will not.

00:04:56.900 --> 00:04:59.900
Lilith, what is this incredible snack?

00:05:00.280 --> 00:05:01.720
Financiers.

00:05:01.720 --> 00:05:03.640
Is it to your liking?

00:05:03.640 --> 00:05:05.590
It's more than to my liking.

00:05:05.590 --> 00:05:07.410
You made these by hand, right?

00:05:07.410 --> 00:05:08.780
You're amazing.

00:05:09.160 --> 00:05:10.880
Thank you.

00:05:11.390 --> 00:05:15.860
You often say you're hungry when 
you get home from school,

00:05:15.860 --> 00:05:19.670
so I made these to hold you over until dinner.

00:05:19.670 --> 00:05:21.900
I could have these for dinner.

00:05:21.900 --> 00:05:23.300
That won't do.

00:05:23.300 --> 00:05:24.440
Aw.

00:05:25.580 --> 00:05:27.050
What's that?

00:05:27.450 --> 00:05:31.590
As I said, I will be helping you 
with sports day preparations.

00:05:31.450 --> 00:05:35.560
<b>For the win!</b>

00:05:31.450 --> 00:05:35.560
Special 
Sports Day
 Training Plan

00:05:31.590 --> 00:05:35.560
So I did some research and 
came up with a training plan.

00:05:35.560 --> 00:05:37.390
A training plan?

00:05:37.850 --> 00:05:40.560
If it's all right with you, 
I will instruct you.

00:05:41.120 --> 00:05:45.650
I'll train you step by step, 
every day, until you're satisfied.

00:05:45.910 --> 00:05:47.260
Really?!

00:05:47.260 --> 00:05:49.880
I'd be happy just having you 
come on sports day.

00:05:49.880 --> 00:05:52.910
Now you're saying you'll 
work me over until then?!

00:05:52.910 --> 00:05:54.750
W-Work you over...

00:05:56.350 --> 00:05:59.520
I'm starting to get excited for sports day.

00:05:59.520 --> 00:06:00.880
Thanks, Lilith.

00:06:02.000 --> 00:06:04.550
I'm very excited, too.

00:06:04.550 --> 00:06:07.340
Let's work hard together.

00:06:07.340 --> 00:06:08.640
Yeah!

00:06:18.530 --> 00:06:22.690
Young master, the trick is 
to throw the ball upward.

00:06:23.090 --> 00:06:24.400
Upward?

00:06:24.400 --> 00:06:28.870
Upward from below, like you're 
making a shot in basketball.

00:06:33.620 --> 00:06:35.770
Aim for just above the basket.

00:06:36.120 --> 00:06:37.430
Got it.

00:06:48.530 --> 00:06:50.840
Heave-ho! Heave-ho!

00:06:50.840 --> 00:06:53.600
Body facing forward, 
rope tucked under your armpit.

00:06:53.600 --> 00:06:56.280
Heave-ho! Heave-ho!

00:06:56.280 --> 00:06:58.640
Knees extended, waist low.

00:06:58.640 --> 00:07:00.850
Heave-ho! Heave-ho!

00:07:01.160 --> 00:07:02.600
That's the way.

00:07:02.600 --> 00:07:05.570
Heave-ho! Heave-ho!

00:07:06.410 --> 00:07:08.070
Young master!

00:07:10.490 --> 00:07:12.490
Boo...

00:07:12.820 --> 00:07:15.400
We're just practicing today.

00:07:15.400 --> 00:07:17.640
You have nothing to worry about.

00:07:17.640 --> 00:07:18.580
Yeah...

00:07:18.580 --> 00:07:21.750
The goal of training is to improve.

00:07:21.750 --> 00:07:25.010
You wouldn't need to practice if you 
had it mastered from the beginning.

00:07:25.010 --> 00:07:26.090
Isn't that right?

00:07:26.490 --> 00:07:28.800
Yeah, you're right.

00:07:28.800 --> 00:07:32.580
Let's move on to the final 
training of the day.

00:07:36.460 --> 00:07:37.500
Ready...

00:07:37.500 --> 00:07:38.310
Go!

00:07:38.640 --> 00:07:40.170
Spine straight!

00:07:40.170 --> 00:07:41.450
Elbows at 90 degrees!

00:07:41.450 --> 00:07:42.900
Hands in a fist!

00:07:43.160 --> 00:07:44.150
You're fast!

00:07:44.150 --> 00:07:46.160
That's a good pace, young master!

00:07:46.850 --> 00:07:52.400
<i>That's what Lilith says, but I want to 
impress her at the end of the day!</i>

00:08:03.680 --> 00:08:05.790
Come on...

00:08:11.390 --> 00:08:13.000
I'm beat.

00:08:13.000 --> 00:08:15.840
I can't move a finger.

00:08:17.030 --> 00:08:19.230
Lilith? Come in.

00:08:22.420 --> 00:08:24.600
Young master, are you all right?

00:08:25.410 --> 00:08:26.590
Just barely.

00:08:26.590 --> 00:08:28.920
We can't have it impacting you tomorrow.

00:08:28.920 --> 00:08:31.020
Shall I give you a massage?

00:08:34.950 --> 00:08:37.360
Does this feel all right?

00:08:37.360 --> 00:08:39.240
Yeah, perfect.

00:08:39.620 --> 00:08:41.070
You're amazing.

00:08:41.070 --> 00:08:43.440
I never knew you could give massages, too.

00:08:43.440 --> 00:08:45.730
And it feels really good.

00:08:46.730 --> 00:08:49.200
Is this part of your magic, as well?

00:08:49.200 --> 00:08:50.710
Suspicious!

00:08:51.090 --> 00:08:55.770
I know all about what feels 
good to you, young master.

00:08:57.640 --> 00:08:58.870
That's not fair!

00:08:58.870 --> 00:09:01.600
Tell me what makes you feel good, too!

00:09:19.490 --> 00:09:21.870
That's a personal best, young master.

00:09:28.030 --> 00:09:28.830
Yes?

00:09:31.690 --> 00:09:34.550
Young lady. May I help you?

00:09:34.550 --> 00:09:36.830
There's nothing I need in particular,

00:09:36.830 --> 00:09:39.090
but can I stay here for a while?

00:09:40.140 --> 00:09:42.350
Of course. Come in.

00:09:42.350 --> 00:09:43.660
Thanks.

00:09:52.510 --> 00:09:55.240
Um... Is something the matter?

00:09:55.240 --> 00:09:57.820
I'm sorry, that was unseemly of me.

00:09:57.820 --> 00:10:00.650
Don't mind me. It's nothing.

00:10:00.650 --> 00:10:04.150
No, you seem quite pained.

00:10:04.150 --> 00:10:06.120
Something must be weighing you down.

00:10:07.290 --> 00:10:10.500
I can't deceive you, Fujisaki.

00:10:12.610 --> 00:10:17.680
Mother and Father can't make 
it to sports day tomorrow.

00:10:18.490 --> 00:10:21.500
They have work. 
There's nothing they can do about it.

00:10:21.500 --> 00:10:24.590
I know that's all it is, but...

00:10:24.590 --> 00:10:25.850
Young lady...

00:10:26.210 --> 00:10:30.380
I smiled about it like a 
grown-up in front of them...

00:10:30.380 --> 00:10:33.940
But I guess I'm still just a child.

00:10:40.120 --> 00:10:41.590
Fujisaki...

00:10:41.590 --> 00:10:45.000
I can't replace their presence there,

00:10:45.000 --> 00:10:48.450
but please let me be by your side tomorrow.

00:10:48.450 --> 00:10:52.290
Do you mean you'll come to sports day?

00:10:54.140 --> 00:10:57.260
I'd never let you be alone.

00:11:02.810 --> 00:11:03.890
Young lady...

00:11:04.960 --> 00:11:06.670
What will I do with you?

00:11:06.670 --> 00:11:07.650
Mweehee.

00:11:07.650 --> 00:11:08.570
Mweehee?

00:11:09.230 --> 00:11:10.420
Y-Young lady...

00:11:10.420 --> 00:11:12.900
Just a little longer!

00:11:12.900 --> 00:11:14.930
Were those tears...

00:11:18.670 --> 00:11:20.760
Young lady!

00:11:31.330 --> 00:11:33.600
<i>It's still so early.</i>

00:11:33.600 --> 00:11:36.080
<i>I woke up before my alarm.</i>

00:11:40.220 --> 00:11:42.510
Today's the big day.

00:11:42.510 --> 00:11:44.770
I have to ensure I'm well-prepared.

00:11:52.000 --> 00:11:54.650
<i>Lilith... She's up so early.</i>

00:11:54.650 --> 00:11:55.850
Young master...

00:11:57.110 --> 00:12:00.560
I hope he likes his lunch.

00:12:07.160 --> 00:12:08.540
Okay, I'm off.

00:12:08.540 --> 00:12:10.520
Off you go.

00:12:10.520 --> 00:12:12.910
I'll come by later.

00:12:13.910 --> 00:12:15.040
What is it?

00:12:15.040 --> 00:12:17.060
Oh, it's nothing.

00:12:17.060 --> 00:12:20.920
Oh, yeah. I want you to
 come dressed comfortably.

00:12:22.090 --> 00:12:24.030
See you later.

00:12:24.030 --> 00:12:24.930
Right.

00:12:25.390 --> 00:12:26.680
Stay safe.

00:12:29.930 --> 00:12:38.340
We pledge to compete fairly, 
in the spirit of good sportsmanship.

00:12:39.970 --> 00:12:43.360
<i>The next game is Tug-o-war.</i>

00:12:43.360 --> 00:12:48.330
<i>All competing students, 
please gather at the center of the field.</i>

00:12:49.680 --> 00:12:52.050
<i>I've done everything I can.</i>

00:12:52.050 --> 00:12:54.790
<i>All that's left to do is demonstrate 
the results of my training.</i>

00:12:54.790 --> 00:12:57.920
<i>Yuuri-san's totally pumped.</i>

00:12:58.330 --> 00:13:03.300
<i>I'm not a good athlete, 
so I'll take it easy.</i>

00:13:03.300 --> 00:13:05.240
Hey, poor kid.

00:13:05.240 --> 00:13:06.970
Don't drag us down, all right?

00:13:09.690 --> 00:13:11.260
Same to you.

00:13:15.700 --> 00:13:17.520
<i>Sparks are flying!</i>

00:13:18.030 --> 00:13:22.450
<i>I've never seen Yuuri-san 
so fiercely competitive.</i>

00:13:23.030 --> 00:13:24.780
Young master!

00:13:26.850 --> 00:13:28.780
Go do your best!

00:13:37.510 --> 00:13:38.670
<i>I see.</i>

00:13:39.230 --> 00:13:43.470
<i>He's so enthusiastic this year because 
his maid's been supporting him.</i>

00:13:45.330 --> 00:13:49.720
Do your best, and I'll have 
a reward waiting for you.

00:13:50.150 --> 00:13:52.180
<i>A r-reward?!</i>

00:13:52.180 --> 00:13:53.140
<i>Suspicious!</i>

00:13:54.540 --> 00:13:55.390
<i>Could it be...</i>

00:13:58.040 --> 00:14:01.220
You did well, young master.

00:14:01.750 --> 00:14:03.740
I'm your reward.

00:14:04.760 --> 00:14:07.570
<i>Is that what's going on?!</i>

00:14:07.570 --> 00:14:08.810
<i>It mustn't be!</i>

00:14:08.810 --> 00:14:12.590
<i>Yuuri and his maid are master and servant!</i>

00:14:12.590 --> 00:14:15.490
<i>They're child and grown-up!</i>

00:14:16.700 --> 00:14:19.620
<i>I need to root for him more than ever.</i>

00:14:20.090 --> 00:14:24.380
<i>I'm going to make the point to her 
that Yuuri-san's working really hard.</i>

00:14:24.380 --> 00:14:29.130
<i>I'll surely bring him victory!</i>

00:14:32.970 --> 00:14:34.500
Let's win, okay?

00:14:35.150 --> 00:14:37.340
Y-Your nose is bleeding.

00:14:37.340 --> 00:14:39.070
Don't mind me.

00:14:39.070 --> 00:14:40.170
Um...

00:14:41.540 --> 00:14:45.150
Let's work as a team and do our best.

00:14:48.400 --> 00:14:49.400
Yeah.

00:14:52.320 --> 00:14:54.260
<i>For his reward!</i>

00:14:55.530 --> 00:14:57.410
<i>For love!</i>

00:14:57.410 --> 00:15:02.950
Heave-ho! Heave-ho!

00:15:02.950 --> 00:15:05.600
<i>White team, hang in there.</i>

00:15:05.600 --> 00:15:07.960
<i>Red team, give it your best.</i>

00:15:10.400 --> 00:15:12.300
You can't give up now!

00:15:12.300 --> 00:15:13.680
Get it!

00:15:27.110 --> 00:15:30.310
Now you can get your reward, huh?

00:15:31.180 --> 00:15:32.440
My reward?

00:15:32.440 --> 00:15:34.950
Yes, from your maid.

00:15:35.570 --> 00:15:42.770
I just want to win,
 and see Lilith smile.

00:15:44.660 --> 00:15:45.760
Young master!

00:15:46.610 --> 00:15:48.910
That was an incredible effort.

00:15:49.570 --> 00:15:51.380
The red team won.

00:15:52.530 --> 00:15:53.970
Amazing!

00:15:54.810 --> 00:15:55.670
Yeah.

00:15:58.500 --> 00:15:59.600
Young lady?!

00:16:01.500 --> 00:16:03.660
They're so beautiful together!

00:16:03.660 --> 00:16:05.730
My eyes!

00:16:04.590 --> 00:16:05.730
Young lady!

00:16:05.750 --> 00:16:10.260
<b>The Maid I Hired Recently
Is Mysterious</b>

00:16:06.780 --> 00:16:09.540
<i>The Maid I Hired Recently Is Mysterious.</i>

00:16:10.260 --> 00:16:13.240
You can do it!

00:16:15.290 --> 00:16:16.850
Are you sure about this?

00:16:16.850 --> 00:16:19.290
First you were there on open house day,

00:16:19.290 --> 00:16:22.840
and now you're here on sports day, 
with all these people present.

00:16:28.250 --> 00:16:30.010
It won't be a problem.

00:16:33.710 --> 00:16:35.880
My young master requested it.

00:16:39.260 --> 00:16:42.790
Good work in the morning half.

00:16:42.790 --> 00:16:44.270
Good work.

00:16:44.540 --> 00:16:48.520
Pardon us for intruding on your lunch.

00:16:48.520 --> 00:16:50.660
You aren't intruding at all.

00:16:50.660 --> 00:16:53.780
The more the merrier at the table.

00:16:53.780 --> 00:16:57.160
Lilith-san sure does get it!

00:16:58.540 --> 00:17:02.660
You should both eat lots so you 
can do well in the afternoon, too.

00:17:02.660 --> 00:17:03.490
Okay!

00:17:03.490 --> 00:17:04.750
Let's eat.

00:17:08.050 --> 00:17:10.260
It really does look delicious.

00:17:10.260 --> 00:17:13.320
Would you like some, Gojouin-sama?

00:17:14.050 --> 00:17:15.340
Really?

00:17:15.340 --> 00:17:16.800
Of course.

00:17:16.800 --> 00:17:18.850
In that case, thank you.

00:17:22.990 --> 00:17:24.840
It's delicious!

00:17:24.840 --> 00:17:26.500
She's good at cooking, too.

00:17:26.500 --> 00:17:28.760
What a fantastic maid.

00:17:31.600 --> 00:17:34.240
Is something the matter, young master?

00:17:34.780 --> 00:17:37.010
Was it an inconvenience for you?

00:17:37.010 --> 00:17:41.080
Coming to the open house and to sports day...

00:17:41.840 --> 00:17:44.810
And getting up so early to make lunch.

00:17:45.800 --> 00:17:47.700
Not at all.

00:17:47.700 --> 00:17:50.210
In fact, I'm happy to do it.

00:17:52.750 --> 00:17:55.470
Are you good at running, then?

00:17:55.470 --> 00:17:57.540
Pardon... me?

00:17:58.200 --> 00:18:01.720
<i>Parents and guardians 
competing in the obstacle race,</i>

00:18:01.720 --> 00:18:04.440
<i>please gather at the entrance.</i>

00:18:05.770 --> 00:18:08.480
<i>Obstacle race?</i>

00:18:08.760 --> 00:18:11.180
Go, Mom!

00:18:12.320 --> 00:18:16.210
My mom was a track runner 
when she was in school.

00:18:16.210 --> 00:18:18.670
My father was awesome, too.

00:18:18.670 --> 00:18:20.730
Go, Onii-sama!

00:18:21.380 --> 00:18:24.990
<i>All family members are welcome to compete.</i>

00:18:26.120 --> 00:18:28.730
I have another request for you, Lilith.

00:18:29.630 --> 00:18:34.050
<i>I'm so happy my young master 
depends on me these days</i>

00:18:34.730 --> 00:18:37.690
<i>that I feel like I'll end up making a mistake.</i>

00:18:39.280 --> 00:18:43.200
<i>What am I to the young master?</i>

00:18:44.080 --> 00:18:47.600
Group A, are you ready?

00:18:48.030 --> 00:18:49.310
Well, then...

00:18:49.310 --> 00:18:51.560
Ready, go!

00:18:53.850 --> 00:18:54.870
<i>No.</i>

00:18:54.870 --> 00:18:57.320
<i>I'm just a hired maid.</i>

00:18:58.690 --> 00:19:01.620
<i>I want to assist my young master 
in growing up healthy.</i>

00:19:02.320 --> 00:19:06.010
<i>That's all I need.</i>

00:19:11.260 --> 00:19:12.500
Lilith!

00:19:12.500 --> 00:19:14.500
Go for it!

00:19:14.900 --> 00:19:17.010
<i>It </i>was<i> all I needed...</i>

00:19:36.040 --> 00:19:38.450
I should have worn a tracksuit, too.

00:19:39.860 --> 00:19:43.570
Oh, yeah. I want you to
 come dressed comfortably.

00:19:44.360 --> 00:19:50.280
<i>So this was why the young master 
wanted me to dress comfortably.</i>

00:19:50.650 --> 00:19:52.740
You're amazing! You came in first!

00:19:52.740 --> 00:19:54.960
You really are a fast runner, huh?

00:19:56.830 --> 00:19:58.710
Aren't you happy?

00:19:58.710 --> 00:19:59.460
I am.

00:20:01.970 --> 00:20:05.730
I did my best... for you.

00:20:05.730 --> 00:20:07.220
Just kidding...

00:20:07.490 --> 00:20:08.270
What?!

00:20:08.270 --> 00:20:10.770
Your maid got first place?!

00:20:10.770 --> 00:20:14.120
How could a maid earn first place 
in a race for parents and guardians?!

00:20:14.120 --> 00:20:16.510
That's not fair, using your maid!

00:20:23.070 --> 00:20:24.490
It's not unfair.

00:20:25.150 --> 00:20:26.610
Lilith is...

00:20:30.180 --> 00:20:32.750
my precious family.

00:20:39.750 --> 00:20:41.740
I-I see...

00:20:41.740 --> 00:20:42.760
Let's go.

00:20:47.040 --> 00:20:48.630
U-Um...

00:20:49.050 --> 00:20:50.840
Thank you.

00:20:51.540 --> 00:20:53.020
But are you sure...

00:20:53.470 --> 00:20:57.020
you should be calling me family, 
when I'm just a maid?

00:20:57.020 --> 00:20:59.650
A maid who's so cute and 
makes such good food,

00:20:59.650 --> 00:21:01.500
who's suspicious and who can do anything,

00:21:01.500 --> 00:21:03.530
is obviously more than just a maid!

00:21:05.340 --> 00:21:08.910
You were shining above 
everyone else back there, too.

00:21:12.690 --> 00:21:15.540
When you're happy, I'm happy.

00:21:15.540 --> 00:21:19.060
When I see you, my chest squeezes tight.

00:21:19.060 --> 00:21:22.420
It's because you're family... Right?

00:21:29.470 --> 00:21:33.230
I don't think that's quite it.

00:21:34.800 --> 00:21:38.960
Are you controlling my mind 
so I feel that way?

00:21:38.960 --> 00:21:40.270
Suspicious!

00:21:43.460 --> 00:21:46.200
You're definitely suspicious!

00:23:19.040 --> 00:23:24.040
<b>Next Time
Episode 6: The Maid I Hired Recently Is Weird!?</b>
